From 84f449ebc9a4bb47c42fc69573fe22024e24115c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 15:56:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Unpack the pipeline into a runnable repo and fix what broke
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

files.zip held the whole pipeline but nothing could import it. Lay the
sources out as a `pipeline` package with the supporting files needed to
actually run: requirements, .env.example, .gitignore, and a fetch script
for the caption fonts the README says are bundled but weren't.

Fixes found by running it:

- Captions landed dead centre, not in the lower third. ASS ignores MarginV
  for the middle alignments (\an4-\an6), so \an5 plus a 520px margin does
  nothing. Emit an explicit \pos() instead.
- run.py loaded fonts from Path("assets/fonts"), relative to the caller's
  cwd, so captions silently lost their font from any other directory.
  Resolve against the package instead.
- A missing font makes libass draw nothing while ffmpeg still exits 0 —
  the failure the README warns about. captions.require_font() now checks
  the file before any encoding starts.
- Crop offsets could be odd, which misaligns the chroma planes on 4:2:0.
  Round to even.
- score.find_clips did Clip(**c) straight on model output: one extra or
  missing key crashed the run after the transcript was already paid for.
  Parse defensively and drop unusable candidates.

Fonts are fetched rather than committed, keeping the repo text-only.
Montserrat only ships as a variable font, so scripts/fetch_fonts.py pins it
at wght=800 and renames the instance — libass matches on family name and
would otherwise fall back to the Regular weight.

smoke.py now asserts rather than just exiting 0: it renders each clip with
and without the subtitle filter and compares them with ffmpeg's psnr, so a
silently-skipped caption fails the test. 6/6 checks pass on ffmpeg 6.1.1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G5dM12wot88EmLkVdm5mbi
